"Boom Town, or Big Boom Town, is a small Apex neighborhood of high-rank Wright workshops."
"It is full of explosions and giant robots, and car interfaces warn drivers nearing it."
"Rent is cheap for the noise, smells and lack of conveniences and decent restaurants."
"Wrights there occasionally blow themselves up."
"It lies between the Celena North campus and the Span."
"Natalie Choir, Hadiza and Emilija share an apartment on the edge of Boom Town."
"Its building halls smell acrid, which is not unusual for the neighborhood."
"Young Wrights live there, including high school Longterm Earth-based Workers."
"Its buildings have honeycomb facades, and Wright scrap litters it."
